WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:08.178
Roxy groaned. "We're stuck on this robot planet!"

2
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:13.153
Cozlin looked around. Broken spaceships lay everywhere.

3
00:00:13.168 --> 00:00:20.130
But none looked like it would still fly. She looked at Dr. Odd's moon.

4
00:00:20.131 --> 00:00:23.852
"Do you think Dr. Odd has something we can use?"

5
00:00:23.853 --> 00:00:30.641
Roxy was confused. "He won't let us borrow a spaceship, if that's what you're thinking."

6
00:00:30.642 --> 00:00:36.247
"No," Cozlin said. "But it sounds like we need to arrest him anyway.

7
00:00:36.248 --> 00:00:39.712
Maybe he has a spaceship in that moon."

8
00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:43.817
Roxy sighed. Cozlin had a point.

9
00:00:43.818 --> 00:00:50.846
Dr. Odd was probably their best chance of getting off this planet.

10
00:00:50.847 --> 00:00:57.709
They flew to the moon and opened a hatch.

11
00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:03.021
Quietly they walked down a hallway.

12
00:01:03.022 --> 00:01:07.452
They arrived at a big door, and Cozlin's device beeped quickly.

13
00:01:07.453 --> 00:01:13.780
"I'm detecting life," Cozlin said. "Dr. Odd is behind this door."

14
00:01:13.781 --> 00:01:17.595
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

15
00:01:17.596 --> 00:01:23.734
The door exploded, and the two superheroes burst into the room.

16
00:01:23.735 --> 00:01:27.484
Dr. Odd was drinking a cup of tea.

17
00:01:27.485 --> 00:01:33.338
He held up his hands. "Stop! Don't destroy anything!"

18
00:01:33.339 --> 00:01:37.748
Roxy was surprised. She expected him to fight.

19
00:01:37.749 --> 00:01:40.119
"Please," Dr. Odd said.

20
00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:44.835
"If we fight in here, my computer controls will all get destroyed.

21
00:01:44.836 --> 00:01:53.504
Then none of us will ever leave this planet."

22
00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:56.758
Roxy gave him a suspicious look.

23
00:01:56.759 --> 00:01:59.828
Dr. Odd held up his hands again.

24
00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:04.854
"I'm unarmed. My big robot is in its charging station.

25
00:02:04.855 --> 00:02:08.089
So please, just listen to me."

26
00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:12.147
Roxy folded her arms. Cozlin did the same.

27
00:02:12.148 --> 00:02:17.171
"Okay," Roxy said. "Talk."

28
00:02:17.172 --> 00:02:20.626
Dr. Odd took a deep breath.

29
00:02:20.627 --> 00:02:25.424
"I told you I didn't harm this planet, and I was telling the truth."

30
00:02:25.425 --> 00:02:28.460
He held out his arms. "This is my moon.

31
00:02:28.461 --> 00:02:34.356
I spent years designing it, and my robots built it while I was in prison.

32
00:02:34.357 --> 00:02:40.842
All I wanted was to travel around the galaxy and explore—by myself.

33
00:02:40.843 --> 00:02:45.883
But then a magnetic force dragged me here, to Groon."

34
00:02:45.884 --> 00:02:52.288
"What happened to Groon?" Cozlin asked. "Where are all of its forests?"

35
00:02:52.289 --> 00:02:59.600
"Robots buried all the forests under layers of metal and machinery," Dr. Odd said.

36
00:02:59.601 --> 00:03:05.949
Roxy narrowed her eyes. "How do you know that?"

37
00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:11.259
Dr. Odd turned on a computer.

38
00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:17.414
"I found this computer deep in the planet while exploring one day. Watch this."

39
00:03:17.415 --> 00:03:21.950
A video showed a small city surrounded by lush forests.

40
00:03:21.951 --> 00:03:26.039
Roxy saw that the aliens in the video looked happy.

41
00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.611
"This is a Groonian city," Dr. Odd said.

42
00:03:30.612 --> 00:03:34.532
Suddenly a dark shadow spread across everything.

43
00:03:34.533 --> 00:03:41.602
The Groonians gazed up toward the sky, looking scared. Then the video ended.

44
00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.130
"That's the only video," Dr. Odd said.

45
00:03:45.131 --> 00:03:50.010
"But I learned more about Groon's history from computer files.

46
00:03:50.011 --> 00:03:54.998
That shadow you saw was an enormous robot named Meltron.

47
00:03:54.999 --> 00:04:02.077
He makes smaller robots, using scrap metal—spaceships, vehicles, even buildings.

48
00:04:02.078 --> 00:04:07.628
Those robots can make more robots, and Meltron controls all of them.

49
00:04:07.629 --> 00:04:11.679
He sends them out to take over other planets."

50
00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:16.948
Cozlin looked sad. "Like mine."

51
00:04:16.949 --> 00:04:20.624
"We have to stop the robots!" Roxy said.

52
00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:24.049
"Before they take over the whole galaxy."

53
00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:30.280
"I know how to do it," Dr. Odd said. "But it won't be easy."

54
00:04:30.281 --> 00:04:33.185
Roxy didn't know if she could trust the man.

55
00:04:33.186 --> 00:04:35.888
But she didn't really have a choice.

56
00:04:35.889 --> 00:04:38.303
"How?" she asked.

57
00:04:38.304 --> 00:04:45.851
He looked grim. "We have to destroy Meltron."

